
=== A. TrueVision's record checks, verbatim - VV leaves + VV config (TV SheetRecords 1.39.0 as the caller)

  The record (the shipped SheetRecords and its NoteRegions leaf)
  PASS  a margin record with no regions gains no key
  PASS  RegionsOn false and an empty list are both dropped
  PASS  regions are kept with the switch off, so switching on puts them back
  PASS  RegionsOn is kept as true
  PASS  what is not a region drops out; the rest keep their order
  PASS  a duplicate id and a missing one take new ids past EVERY id on the list
  PASS  a frame is held to the least size and a size that is not a number takes it
  PASS  a blank title is the automatic one (null); a typed one is kept as typed
  PASS  groups keep their order with no repeats; an id the specification lacks is KEPT
  PASS  a border never written takes the default (all on as shipped)
  PASS  a region that says nothing takes no overspill and no group
  PASS  a new region: the next id, the overspill, no group, every border
  PASS  the readers: on, kept, drawn, and one by id

  The record (the shipped SheetRecords and its LeaderlessNotes leaf)
  PASS  a margin record without them gains no key
  PASS  LeaderlessOn false and an empty list are both dropped
  PASS  the groups are kept with the switch off, so switching on puts them back
  PASS  only a real true switches it on
  PASS  strings only, in their order, no repeats; an id the specification lacks is KEPT
  PASS  beside the regions: both kept, the regions first
  PASS  a normalised record normalises byte-identical
  PASS  the readers: on, kept, and listed only while on
  PASS  the readers on a sheet with no margin record
  PASS  the reader hands back a copy: changing it changes nothing
  PASS  a tick joins the foot of the list
  PASS  a group ticked twice stays where it is
  PASS  an untick takes it out and keeps the rest in order
  PASS  a tick with no id changes nothing
  PASS  dropped on a later group it lands after it (the Layers grip's rule)
  PASS  dropped on an earlier group it lands before it
  PASS  to the very top and the very foot
  PASS  an index past either end is held to it
  PASS  a group the list lacks, no move, or no index: unchanged
  -> 32/32 pass

